Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 18:57:53 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] flatten resample_sse.h to resample_sse.c

Mozilla builds the SSE inner-product code as a standalone translation
unit; upstream ships it as the header libspeexdsp/resample_sse.h. UXP
update.sh copies it to resample_sse.c; replicate with a pure rename,
no content change.
---
diff --git a/libspeexdsp/resample_sse.h b/libspeexdsp/resample_sse.c
similarity index 100%
rename from libspeexdsp/resample_sse.h
rename to libspeexdsp/resample_sse.c
